# RPC Provider

## The Alchemy API key (see https://www.alchemy.com/), used by the `rpc_endpoints` of `foundry.toml` for deployments

export ALCHEMY_API_KEY=<ALCHEMY_API_KEY>

# Deployment

## The address owning the deployed proxy. It is part of the initializer calldata and therefore of the deterministic address, and upgrades are simulated as it.

export FWD_OWNER=<FWD_OWNER>

# Verification

## The Etherscan API key (see https://etherscan.io/apis), used by `just contracts-verify-impl-etherscan`

export ETHERSCAN_API_KEY=<ETHERSCAN_API_KEY>
